if GameState.get_flag("act1/ready_to_leave") == true:
	Your friend waits at the village edge, sword slung over his shoulder, and waves you on toward the trees.
	jump end
if GameState.get_flag("act1/said_farewell") == true:
	He grins as you climb back down. Said your goodbyes, then? Good. Let us not waste the light.
	[signal arg="set_flag act1/ready_to_leave"]
	jump end
if GameState.get_flag("act1/talked_to_friend") == true:
	He nods his head toward the old tower. Aeia is still up there, waiting. Go on.
	jump end
Your oldest friend claps a hand on your shoulder, grinning wide. Walk with me down to the shore, like when we were children?
- Race you there.
	He laughs, bright and easy, and swears you will be eating his dust before the treeline.
- Lets stay close out there, Elder Mishka said a thick mist is creeping in.
	[signal arg="set_flag act1/promised_to_protect"]
	Something in him softens. Always, brother. You and me, back to back, the way it has always been.
He gestures toward the cracked tower behind you. But say your goodbye to Aeia first. She would never forgive either of us if we got lost in the mist.
[signal arg="set_flag act1/talked_to_friend"]
label end